From 2e66b07e6c6cf5bbb6aabe116b049b744326ce44 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 00:20:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Connect frontend, backend and AI agent

- Restore the missing static fallback data file (a bare 'data/' gitignore rule
  was silently excluding it), so OSRM outages serve labeled static routes
- Add the Role 3 explanation agent bridge with three runtimes: in-process JS,
  the deployed Python function over HTTP, and a local python subprocess
- Evaluate time buckets in local time (TIME_BUCKET_UTC_OFFSET_MIN)
- Restore CORS_ORIGIN support (hardcoded '*' broke the U-004 config test)
- Wire the frontend Why panel to /api/explain-context and make the destination
  search real instead of a hardcoded label
